==Acquisition==
This [[Cosmetics#Capes and Cards|cosmetic set]], found on page one of the [[Force of Law Premium Warbond#Page 1|Force of Law]] Premium [[Warbond]], can be claimed separately for {{Currency|Medals|8|notext}} and 2 [[Medal]]s.

